# This repo holds three Vercel projects, each with its own Root Directory:
#   backend/           -> API project
#   leadgen-frontend/  -> dashboard project
#   (repo root)        -> optional static landing page. Do NOT keep a project on the repo root:
#                         it would publish every folder as static files. Delete it or give it its own folder.
# This file therefore must NOT exclude backend/ or leadgen-frontend/ (it did, which broke their builds).

# Tooling
n8n/
.github/
.git/

# Docs, design & records (not part of the deployed site)
docs/
evidences/
records/
logs/
figma/
notion/

# Non-site root files
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
LICENSE
docker-compose.yml
.editorconfig
.nvmrc

# Build/runtime artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/__pycache__/
